(A multicentre investigation examined personalised dietary counselling against standard care) Tj
T*
(in 339 adults with hypertension. The observed difference was clinically interpretable for) Tj
T*
(systolic blood pressure, while treatment exposure and adverse events were broadly comparable) Tj
T*
(between groups. The findings should be considered alongside short follow-up and incomplete) Tj
T*
(adherence data. Differences in adherence were more pronounced among participants recruited) Tj
T*
(through community services. This report is from a parallel-group randomized controlled trial) Tj
T*
(comparing Control: routine care vs Intervention: mindfulness sessions + educational) Tj
